# Roadmap OS runs with NO environment variables: progress is stored in the browser
# and the curriculum ships as static JSON in data/.
#
# Optional: the embedded Socratic tutor (docs/AI.md). Server-side only.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
# ROADMAP_AI_ACCESS_TOKEN=a-long-random-shared-secret-16-plus-chars
# ROADMAP_AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
#
# Future: cloud sync (docs/PERSISTENCE.md) would need:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development and add the same values in
# Vercel (Project Settings > Environment Variables). Never commit .env.local.
